PASS candidate_execution_manifest_matches_current_hash: every P3-075 execution-manifest SHA-256 entry matches its current read-only file
PASS first_explicit_confirmed_submission: CLI succeeds only with explicit confirmations; identities and closure state are visible
PASS idempotent_repeat: same key and same text returns duplicate without a second record
PASS close_reopen_persistence: fresh SQLite connection reads only the committed record
PASS empty_input_fail_closed: empty text is visibly rejected with no record, audit, or next step
PASS missing_save_confirmation_fail_closed: missing save confirmation leaves no record, audit, or next step
PASS missing_next_step_confirmation_blocked: save remains committed because it had its own confirmation; unconfirmed next step is absent
PASS same_key_different_text_rejected_without_overwrite: conflicting replay is visible and cannot overwrite original text
PASS precommit_failure_atomic_rollback: injected pre-commit failure discloses failure and removes pending artifacts
PASS unknown_project_restore_rejected: public restore interface rejects an unknown project
PASS prohibited_external_channels_static_closed: no URL/network client import; declared network/Tauri/external-action boundaries remain closed
PASS candidate_copy_matches_original_hash: fresh copied candidate sources match original pre-run hashes
PASS historical_assets_preserved: candidate, P3-075 delivery, PM review, and manifest hashes unchanged after review
